  "sentences": [
    {"text": "A fiery, crimson sunset blazed across the western sky.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "The molten, golden sun sank behind the hills, and the valley filled with shadow like a cup.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Streaks of amber and violet stained the clouds long after the sun itself had gone.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "The soft, fading light melted into dusk so gradually that no one could have named the moment.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Long, deepening shadows stretched across the grass.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A still, balmy evening settled over the village, and doors were left open to it.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Blue, deepening twilight gathered in the corners of the garden.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Black silhouettes of trees stood out against the afterglow, every twig distinct.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Darting, flickering bats flitted above the rooftops.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "The first, faint stars pricked through the darkening sky.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Warm, yellow lamplight glowed in the windows, and the street began to feel like an invitation.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "One by one, the street lamps flickered into life.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A chill, grey dusk crept across the empty fields.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "Thickening, purple gloom swallowed the far end of the lane.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The last, dying embers of daylight faded from the horizon.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "A deep, tranquil hush fell over the valley.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "The air cooled as the sun went down, and she pulled her jacket closer.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Under a sombre, bruised sky, the church tower looked taller than it had by day.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Swifts screamed and swooped between the chimneys, making the most of the last light.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Children were called in from the street, one reluctant name at a time.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "The wind rose at sundown and tore the clouds into long, red rags.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "The whole sky smouldered like the mouth of a furnace.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "It was the loneliest hour of the day, when lights came on in other people's houses.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "She watched the light go and realised that nobody was coming.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "In the dusk, every hedge seemed to crouch.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The shadows thickened under the trees, and the path ahead grew uncertain.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The lake held the sunset perfectly, as though the sky had been poured into it.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "The colour bled slowly out of the sky, leaving a single bright star.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Moths bumped softly against the lamp, and somewhere a blackbird sang the day out.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "The daylight dimmed, and the first windows winked on across the valley.", "vibe": "General"}
  ]
